**Real Estate Finance Transactions (Acquisitions/Disposals/Liquidations/Restructuring)**
**Transactional Accounting**

* Review Fund flow and provide comments to REU and BX;
* Prepare acquisition entries based on Fund flow;
* Analysing structures of newly acquired projects and scrutinizing their Tax Structure Memorandums;
* Prepare Day1 accounting entries and opening balances based on completions accounts;
