* Assist the Associate in coordinating between different parties – internal (BX, Revantage Legal & Compliance, Tax , Treasury, etc), external parties (Service provider, lawyers, tax advisors, auditors, liquidators) to ensure internal liquidation processes are followed and liquidation constraints are identified and dealt with/tackled - where applicable.

**Profile**

* Analytical mind-set and logical thinking
