* Fluency in English (verbally and in writing) is a compulsory requirement
* Proficient user of MS Office, high level especially in Excel; Yardi ERP knowledge will be an advantage.
* Excellent organisation skills;
* Fast learner;
* Goal oriented and hands on mentality;
* Ability to work independently yet cooperatively and always with professionalism.
* Team player, ready to take initiatives, to think out-of-the-box;

